OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of heavy
OL,6,Frain in the early morning. This will
OL,7,Fturn showery by mid-morning before
OL,8,Fbecoming dry and then brighter later
OL,9,Fin the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will be mostly
OL,12,Fdry with only a chance of an odd
OL,13,Fshower. The night will then continue
OL,14,Fdry with clear periods.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FDry with bright or sunny
OL,17,Fspells in the morning becoming cloudy
OL,18,Ffrom the early afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
